# calib.expect — P2-3 boot-calibration contrast gate (calibration ON, default).
# Asserts the boot calibration MEASURED and APPLIED the injected raw bias, then flew an
# ALTITUDE_HOLD hover with the ESKF attitude bounded. The "without calibration" half is
# demonstrated by re-running with SIL_EMU_NO_CALIB=1 (see calib.scn) — not gated here.
# 校正 ON（既定）の対照ゲート。起動校正が注入した生バイアスを測定・適用し、ALT_HOLD
# ホバーを ESKF 姿勢有界で飛んだことを検証する。「校正なし」側は SIL_EMU_NO_CALIB=1 の
# 再実行で実証（ここではゲートしない）。
#
# XFAIL (known issue, tracked 2026-07-26): the injected IMU bias combined with the new
# ODE plant's takeoff dynamics produces a 0.6-0.7 Hz self-oscillation, close to the
# real-hardware ACRO ~0.9 Hz limit-cycle band (2026-06-24 diagnosis). See
# docs/architecture/simulation-policy.md backlog #4 (motor dead-band) / #13
# (attitude damping-margin investigation).
# XFAIL（既知課題・追跡中 2026-07-26）: 注入IMUバイアス×新ODEプラントの離陸動特性が
# 0.6-0.7Hz の自励振動を生む — 実機 ACRO の ~0.9Hz リミットサイクル帯域に近い
# （2026-06-24 診断）。simulation-policy.md バックログ#4（モータ不感帯）/#13
# （姿勢減衰余裕の調査）参照。
xfail: injected IMU bias x new ODE-plant takeoff dynamics produce a 0.6-0.7 Hz self-oscillation, close to the ~0.9 Hz real-hardware ACRO limit-cycle band (simulation-policy backlog #4/#13)
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"                       # G1: IDLE_GROUND → ARMED_GROUND
log_contains any "Takeoff complete"                   # G1: TAKEOFF → FLYING
log_contains any "Boot calibration applied"           # the calibration measured + seeded the injected bias
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"  # in-flight ALTITUDE_HOLD engage
log_contains any "DISARM accepted"                    # FLYING → IDLE_GROUND
metric att_rmse < 5.0 in 10.0 18.0   # G2: with calibration, ESKF attitude tracks truth (bias removed)
metric tilt_max < 18.0 in 10.0 18.0  # G3: attitude bounded (no tumble)
